[32m+[m[32m### Effect safety[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32mOnly one GPU effect can be active at a time. Enabling one effect automatically resets the others to zero. This avoids unstable or excessively expensive shader chains on some graphics drivers.[m
[32m+[m
