[32m+[m[32m## Custom effects[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32mEffects are discovered at runtime. Each effect is a folder containing:[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32m```text[m
[32m+[m[32mmy-effect/[m
[32m+[m[32m├── effect.ini[m
[32m+[m[32m└── shader.glsl[m
[32m+[m[32m```[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32mSystem effects are installed under:[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32m```text[m
[32m+[m[32m/usr/local/share/xfce-animated-wallpaper/effects/[m
[32m+[m[32m```[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32mUser effects can be installed without root under:[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32m```text[m
[32m+[m[32m~/.local/share/xfce-animated-wallpaper/effects/[m
[32m+[m[32m```[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32mA minimal `effect.ini` looks like:[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32m```ini[m
[32m+[m[32m[Effect][m
[32m+[m[32mid=my_effect[m
[32m+[m[32mname=My Effect[m
[32m+[m[32mdescription=What the effect does.[m
[32m+[m[32mshader=shader.glsl[m
[32m+[m[32mmin=0[m
[32m+[m[32mmax=100[m
[32m+[m[32mstep=1[m
[32m+[m[32mdigits=0[m
[32m+[m[32mdefault=0[m
[32m+[m[32morder=100[m
[32m+[m[32m```[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32mThe GLSL template uses `@VALUE@` where the slider value should be baked into the shader:[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32m```glsl[m
[32m+[m[32m//!HOOK MAIN[m
[32m+[m[32m//!BIND HOOKED[m
[32m+[m[32m//!DESC My Effect[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32mvec4 hook() {[m
[32m+[m[32m    float strength = clamp(@VALUE@ / 100.0, 0.0, 1.0);[m
[32m+[m[32m    vec4 c = HOOKED_tex(HOOKED_pos);[m
[32m+[m[32m    // apply effect...[m
[32m+[m[32m    return c;[m
[32m+[m[32m}[m
[32m+[m[32m```[m
